# Theme preview images for selection UI

Place preview images here for the theme selection on `/create`:

- **fireman-preview.jpg** (or `.webp`) - Preview shown when user selects Fireman theme
- **spaceman-preview.jpg** (or `.webp`) - Preview shown when user selects Spaceman theme

## Image requirements

- **Format:** JPEG or WebP
- **Size:** Square or vertical format recommended (e.g., 400x400px or 400x600px)
- **Purpose:** Visual preview to help users choose a theme
- **Optimization:** Compress for web (aim for <200KB per image)

## Usage

The images are automatically displayed in the theme selection buttons on `/create`. If an image is missing, the button will show a placeholder background and the image will be hidden gracefully.

## Adding new themes

1. Add the preview image here: `{theme-name}-preview.jpg`
2. Update `app/create/page.tsx` to include the new theme option
3. Update `app/api/create-portrait/route.ts` validation to include the new theme
4. Update n8n workflow to handle the new theme (see `docs/N8N_THEME_SELECTION.md`)
